WEBVTT

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:19.240
<i>Once upon a time</i>
<i>there lived a bamboo cutter.</i>

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:24.500
<i>On the mountain, he would cut bamboo</i>

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:27.370
<i>to make all manner of things.</i>

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:33.960
<i>Sanuki no Miyatsuko was his name.</i>

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:42.430
<i>One day, he saw light shining</i>
<i>from a bamboo stalk.</i>

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.310
<i>In wonder, he drew closer.</i>

00:01:56.490 --> 00:02:01.830
A bamboo shoot sprouting
before the plums flower?

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:10.670
What's this?

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:33.690
Um...

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.900
may I ask who you might be?

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:11.980
What a beautiful princess!

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:17.230
Heaven must have sent her
to me as a blessing.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.750
Did you catch something?

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:22.880
What a pretty doll!

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:25.260
No, she's sleeping.

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:26.470
What?

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:34.020
I've been blessed.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:35.310
Blessed?

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.440
By Heaven, in the grove!

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:43.110
It's me Heaven has blessed.

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:45.490
I'm the one who'll raise her.

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:49.200
Raise her?
She's already a beautiful princess.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:52.200
There'll be more to this than you think.

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:53.410
Right?

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:00.840
Give her here!

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:20.110
Don't just sit there! Bring me a cloth.

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:24.860
How's this?

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:32.160
There, there!

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.410
What's going on?

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:36.870
She wants me to raise her.

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:42.300
Get me a nice basket.

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:46.970
This is very strange, you know.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.760
What if she's some kind of spirit?

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:50.720
What does she look like?

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.720
A baby.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:55.930
-Right!
-But just now, she was a princess!

00:05:56.020 --> 00:06:01.900
That was Heaven telling us
who she'll grow into.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:02.940
Really?

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:07.030
So that means we must raise her properly.

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:09.110
Yes! That must be it.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.320
Yes.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.870
I see!

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.870
But who'll nurse her?

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:16.580
A wet nurse.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:20.290
And the lathe turners have a new baby.

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:23.380
-So this is...
-A gift.

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:26.210
What's the matter?

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:43.560
What are you doing?

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:49.240
There, there! You must be hungry.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:50.660
What?

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:54.030
She's drinking it right down.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.410
I've got milk!

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:26.520
She laughed!

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:28.780
She did!

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:32.530
Suddenly, she feels heavier.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:33.820
That can't be!

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:52.880
-Now what?
-She's heavier still!

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:54.470
Let me see.

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:58.510
She's growing really fast.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:18.490
Plum blossoms already!

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:30.340
She just got heavier again!

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:31.840
You see?

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:34.760
Well, I'll be!

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:41.560
<i>From that day on,</i>
<i>the Bamboo Cutter and his wife</i>

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:44.560
<i>would raise this miraculous child</i>
<i>as their very own.</i>

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:49.000
No! You can't have those yet.

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:58.180
There's a baby!

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:00.470
Yeah? Where?

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:03.100
Don't push!

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:04.310
There!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:26.870
She looked at us!

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:28.750
-Yeah!
-No.

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:48.930
What is it?

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:06.450
-Oh, my!
-Well, I'll be!

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.310
Princess!

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:34.980
She's standing!

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:39.780
She's walking!

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:47.950
Oh, my!

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:04.300
There, there...

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:06.430
She's funny!

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:07.470
She walked.

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:08.890
She was just crawling.

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:10.310
She's growing fast!

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:13.190
Like a bamboo shoot!

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:15.060
That's her! Li'l Bamboo!

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.190
Li'l Bamboo!

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:17.310
Li'l Bamboo!

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:20.360
Li'l Bamboo!

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:23.820
She's not Li'l Bamboo! She's Princess!

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:27.830
Li'l Bamboo!

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:31.830
Li'l Bamboo!

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:36.920
Li'l Bamboo!

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:44.800
Princess! Come to me!

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:47.140
Princess! Come to me!

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:52.140
Princess! Come to me!

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:54.890
Li'l Bamboo!

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:59.150
Princess! Come to me!

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:03.150
Li'l Bamboo!

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:05.950
Li'l Bamboo!

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:11.080
Princess! Come to me!

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:14.660
Princess! Come to me!

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:17.880
Princess! Come to me!

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:01.750
Do you want to come?

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:24.280
Bamboo shoots. That's supper.

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:27.740
Supper! Bamboo shoots!

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:33.620
Right! Stand back.

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.630
There are lots!

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.210
Yeah!

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:16.410
Come here!

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:48.530
You don't mess with a wild boar!

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:51.990
Huh?

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:57.200
You're a strange kid. You just got bigger.

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:59.750
She's weird, Sutemaru.

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:03.210
She's gotten bigger again!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:05.540
Like a bamboo shoot.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.550
-A bamboo shoot?
-Bamboo shoot! Supper!

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:11.050
Bamboo shoot!

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:12.840
Li'l Bamboo!

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:14.340
Li'l Bamboo!

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:21.520
<i>Round, round, go round</i>

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:25.400
<i>Waterwheel go round</i>

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:29.320
<i>Go round, and call Mr. Sun</i>

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:33.450
<i>Go round, and call Mr. Sun</i>

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:37.490
<i>Birds, bugs, beasts</i>

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:41.410
<i>Grass, trees, flowers</i>

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:45.370
<i>Bring spring and summer, autumn and winter</i>

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:49.380
<i>Bring spring and summer, autumn and winter</i>

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:51.460
-Birds!
-Bugs!

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:53.470
Beasts!

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:56.590
Grass! Trees! Flowers!

00:16:57.470 --> 00:16:58.800
<i>Bring spring and...</i>

00:16:58.890 --> 00:17:02.310
Huh? Do you know this song?

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:03.350
Yes!

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:09.860
<i>Go round, come round, come round</i>

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:14.610
<i>Come round, O distant time</i>

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:19.410
<i>Come round, call back my heart</i>

00:17:19.490 --> 00:17:24.750
<i>Come round, call back my heart</i>

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:30.130
<i>Birds, bugs, beasts</i>

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:35.260
<i>Grass, trees, flowers</i>

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:40.680
<i>Teach me how to feel</i>

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:46.600
<i>If I hear that you pine for me</i>

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:52.690
<i>I will return to you</i>

00:17:58.240 --> 00:17:59.620
That's a weird song.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:01.410
She's crying!

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:02.490
Yeah!

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:05.040
What's wrong?

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:07.870
I don't know.

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.170
She's weird!

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:14.800
We live over there.

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:17.300
That's your bamboo grove.

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:22.550
Bamboo shoots!

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:25.680
Let's go!

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:34.570
Princess!

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:37.610
Where are you?

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:41.660
Princess!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.170
What's that?

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:20.450
Could this be...?

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:05.280
See you later!

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.740
Be careful!

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:12.540
Should we be letting her
play with those boys?

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:15.290
She's fine with them.

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:19.250
It's just that up in the grove, I found...

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:22.130
No. It's nothing.

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:36.440
That's lacquer. You'll get a rash!

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:38.020
Lacquer?

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:44.950
That smells good!

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:47.950
We'll make bowls from them.

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:49.030
From these?

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:54.830
Wow!

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:57.790
That's my dad,
my elder brother, and my mom.

00:21:11.890 --> 00:21:14.600
-Goodbye!
-Goodbye!

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.600
Bring us something back!

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:19.730
The Bamboo Cutter's girl.

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:22.860
Li'l Bamboo.

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:32.950
Come on, Li'l Bamboo!

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.810
It's so hot!

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:56.060
I'm thirsty.

00:22:10.740 --> 00:22:13.620
I'll bet those are good.

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:14.660
Yeah?

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:16.830
Don't!

00:22:27.510 --> 00:22:28.550
Come on!

00:22:29.890 --> 00:22:30.930
Someone's coming!

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:45.940
Leave it!

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:53.220
This is for the others.

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:11.490
This is good!

00:24:12.150 --> 00:24:13.660
This is good!

00:24:47.520 --> 00:24:51.990
When these beautiful clothes
came flying out, I realized

00:24:52.070 --> 00:24:53.860
what Heaven wants.

00:24:54.700 --> 00:24:56.450
What Heaven wants?

00:24:58.160 --> 00:25:03.620
It wants us to give her a life
that suits these robes.

00:25:03.710 --> 00:25:05.750
To make her a noble princess.

00:25:07.290 --> 00:25:08.500
A noble princess?

00:25:10.840 --> 00:25:15.260
With this gold, I'll build her
a fine mansion in the capital.

00:25:21.430 --> 00:25:23.180
Take her there?

00:25:23.270 --> 00:25:24.140
Yes.

00:25:24.390 --> 00:25:27.270
Out here, she'll always be
just a country girl.

00:25:27.770 --> 00:25:33.320
Living with nobles as a real princess,

00:25:33.400 --> 00:25:35.320
she'll be happy.

00:25:35.400 --> 00:25:38.780
In any case, that is Heaven's wish.

00:25:39.660 --> 00:25:41.280
A noble princess?

00:25:41.790 --> 00:25:42.700
Yes.

00:25:43.040 --> 00:25:46.120
Anyway, tomorrow, I'll go to the capital.

00:26:11.980 --> 00:26:15.650
<i>From the next day on, the Bamboo Cutter</i>

00:26:15.740 --> 00:26:19.200
<i>went often to the capital,</i>
<i>with gold in his kimono.</i>

00:26:23.200 --> 00:26:26.200
<i>The summer went by,</i>

00:26:26.290 --> 00:26:28.920
<i>and the autumn harvest came round.</i>

00:26:31.880 --> 00:26:35.800
<i>Blow, O wind, blow, blow</i>

00:26:35.880 --> 00:26:41.390
<i>Blow hard, O wind</i>

00:26:41.470 --> 00:26:43.850
Li'l Bamboo! Take him!

00:26:43.930 --> 00:26:47.810
<i>Bring the fruits of the mountains</i>

00:26:47.890 --> 00:26:54.860
<i>Chestnuts, mushrooms, grapes...</i>

00:26:56.070 --> 00:26:57.990
Carry me!

00:27:02.950 --> 00:27:05.120
Carry me!

00:27:19.470 --> 00:27:21.800
I'll rub it all over you!

00:27:25.390 --> 00:27:26.680
A pheasant!

00:27:28.060 --> 00:27:30.270
It's heading for you!

00:27:30.690 --> 00:27:32.770
Li'l Bamboo! Chase it left!

00:27:33.100 --> 00:27:34.020
Okay!

00:27:46.030 --> 00:27:47.410
It's coming your way!

00:27:47.490 --> 00:27:48.660
Get it!

00:27:57.340 --> 00:27:58.340
I'll get you!

00:28:08.310 --> 00:28:09.600
Sutemaru!

00:28:10.020 --> 00:28:11.390
Sutemaru!

00:28:13.900 --> 00:28:14.770
Sutemaru!

00:28:19.480 --> 00:28:21.570
-Sutemaru!
-Sutemaru!

00:28:27.660 --> 00:28:28.620
I got it.

00:28:29.740 --> 00:28:31.000
I got it!

00:28:31.080 --> 00:28:33.120
Great!

00:28:34.250 --> 00:28:36.330
Are you hurt? I'm coming down.

00:28:39.460 --> 00:28:40.630
No!

00:28:50.520 --> 00:28:51.810
Sutemaru!

00:28:52.520 --> 00:28:54.890
The rocks are weak here!

00:28:57.900 --> 00:29:01.190
-I'm sorry.
-Get a long vine, will you?

00:29:01.280 --> 00:29:02.360
Okay!

00:29:03.900 --> 00:29:05.910
You're bleeding.

00:29:06.450 --> 00:29:08.200
A little spit'll fix that.

00:29:09.490 --> 00:29:10.450
No!

00:29:11.830 --> 00:29:12.750
Wait.

00:29:26.470 --> 00:29:27.550
There.

00:29:31.100 --> 00:29:32.060
Li'l Bamboo...

00:29:33.310 --> 00:29:34.980
did you get bigger again?

00:29:35.310 --> 00:29:37.560
You think so?

00:29:38.770 --> 00:29:42.860
Somehow, I have the feeling
you'll just keep on growing

00:29:43.860 --> 00:29:46.400
and go somewhere far away.

00:29:48.990 --> 00:29:50.830
Why do you say that?

00:29:51.660 --> 00:29:55.370
I'll always be here with you,
forever and ever.

00:29:55.660 --> 00:29:58.460
I'll always be one of your gang.

00:29:58.710 --> 00:30:00.040
Sutemaru!

00:30:00.130 --> 00:30:01.500
How's this?

00:30:02.300 --> 00:30:03.170
Good.

00:30:08.720 --> 00:30:10.680
-Tie it!
-We have!

00:30:10.760 --> 00:30:11.680
Right!

00:30:15.230 --> 00:30:16.270
Go on.

00:30:20.230 --> 00:30:22.980
Hey, there are mushrooms here!

00:30:23.820 --> 00:30:25.070
Look, Sutemaru!

00:30:25.740 --> 00:30:26.570
You're right!

00:30:26.950 --> 00:30:30.700
Look at them all!
Tomorrow, let's have a stew!

00:30:31.280 --> 00:30:33.200
Yeah! We'll cook this bird.

00:30:33.740 --> 00:30:35.200
Great! Pheasant stew!

00:30:35.870 --> 00:30:40.210
Pheasant! Pheasant stew!

00:30:53.220 --> 00:30:54.810
Sorry I'm late.

00:30:56.180 --> 00:30:58.430
Sutemaru caught a pheasant.

00:30:58.520 --> 00:31:00.690
And we found mushrooms and grapes!

00:31:04.520 --> 00:31:05.940
Where are you going?

00:31:06.440 --> 00:31:07.530
The capital.

00:31:07.610 --> 00:31:08.740
The capital?

00:31:10.150 --> 00:31:11.200
Me, too?

00:31:12.740 --> 00:31:15.950
-Now?
-Yes. Leave that basket there.

00:31:16.290 --> 00:31:20.670
But I told Sutemaru
we'd all have pheasant stew.

00:31:20.870 --> 00:31:22.170
Leave it.

00:31:28.340 --> 00:31:30.300
Let's go.

00:31:51.280 --> 00:31:54.320
Will we be back in time for stew tomorrow?

00:31:55.490 --> 00:31:59.620
<i>But for the Princess and Sutemaru,</i>

00:31:59.700 --> 00:32:01.500
<i>that tomorrow never came.</i>

00:32:41.370 --> 00:32:43.330
The young miss is awake.

00:32:48.590 --> 00:32:50.300
Good morning.

00:33:16.820 --> 00:33:17.870
If you please...

00:33:57.610 --> 00:34:00.030
Well, well, well!

00:34:00.120 --> 00:34:04.660
I trust Your Highest is in
the bestest of spirits this finest

00:34:05.120 --> 00:34:06.410
of mornings?

00:34:09.630 --> 00:34:10.670
Mom?

00:34:16.470 --> 00:34:18.180
Dad? Is that you?

00:34:28.230 --> 00:34:29.810
You scared me!

00:34:29.900 --> 00:34:32.690
Why are you dressed like that?

00:34:32.770 --> 00:34:34.780
It doesn't suit us, does it?

00:34:34.860 --> 00:34:35.820
Now, now!

00:34:36.530 --> 00:34:41.410
Get yourself a range of chobe,
I mean, a change of robe!

00:34:42.200 --> 00:34:44.080
In there.

00:34:50.370 --> 00:34:53.710
All those robes are yours, Your Highness.

00:35:00.300 --> 00:35:01.510
They smell so nice!

00:35:08.230 --> 00:35:09.560
They're beautiful!

00:35:14.360 --> 00:35:16.280
Like a rainbow!

00:35:21.990 --> 00:35:24.740
I'm glad she likes them.

00:35:24.830 --> 00:35:26.120
I told you!

00:35:26.540 --> 00:35:29.500
You're going to live here now.

00:35:33.750 --> 00:35:34.960
In this mansion?

00:35:35.040 --> 00:35:36.090
Yes.

00:35:44.890 --> 00:35:46.560
Wow!

00:36:14.750 --> 00:36:18.090
Dad, can I swim in there?

00:36:20.460 --> 00:36:23.260
You most certainly may not.

00:36:26.550 --> 00:36:31.640
A noble princess does not frolic
and dance around in such a manner.

00:36:33.140 --> 00:36:34.480
Your Highness,

00:36:34.560 --> 00:36:36.230
I've summoned Lady Sagami

00:36:36.310 --> 00:36:40.650
from the palace to teach you

00:36:40.740 --> 00:36:43.740
the ways of a noble princess.

00:36:43.820 --> 00:36:45.490
A noble princess?

00:36:46.490 --> 00:36:47.580
Palace?

00:36:50.370 --> 00:36:55.080
I have never met a child
so much in need of my instruction.

00:36:55.710 --> 00:37:00.590
I will undertake to make her

00:37:00.670 --> 00:37:02.550
a truly fine lady.

00:37:04.340 --> 00:37:07.260
<i>And so with Lady Sagami,</i>

00:37:07.350 --> 00:37:11.470
<i>the Princess began to learn</i>
<i>the noble airs and graces of a lady.</i>

00:37:12.520 --> 00:37:13.980
Watch carefully.

00:37:14.640 --> 00:37:19.320
One holds one's back straight,
and stands with a swish.

00:37:21.230 --> 00:37:22.280
Swish?

00:37:24.610 --> 00:37:26.490
That will do for now.

00:37:26.990 --> 00:37:31.330
In any event, a noble lady stands
only on rare occasions.

00:37:32.790 --> 00:37:36.000
Then how do I move to pick something up?

00:37:36.080 --> 00:37:37.750
In that case... thus!

00:37:37.830 --> 00:37:41.920
One proceeds on one's knees,
and always gracefully.

00:37:47.390 --> 00:37:48.930
Be graceful at all times...

00:37:51.680 --> 00:37:54.890
Your Highness!

00:38:00.610 --> 00:38:02.400
Beautiful, is it not?

00:38:02.480 --> 00:38:06.740
Unroll it like this,
and the story flows out in the pictures.

00:38:10.240 --> 00:38:12.540
Yeah! It really flows!

00:38:23.920 --> 00:38:25.800
Let us have a short rest.

00:38:26.800 --> 00:38:30.510
Your enthusiasm for practicing handwriting

00:38:30.890 --> 00:38:33.220
makes me proud.

00:38:41.610 --> 00:38:42.820
Your Highness!

00:38:50.110 --> 00:38:52.410
Once more, together.

00:38:58.160 --> 00:38:59.830
Hey, this is fun!

00:39:00.080 --> 00:39:01.330
Your Highness!

00:39:02.500 --> 00:39:03.790
Well?

00:39:03.880 --> 00:39:06.800
How's the koto practice going?

00:39:06.880 --> 00:39:08.470
Sir!

00:39:14.930 --> 00:39:18.480
I trust you are well, Father.

00:39:18.810 --> 00:39:19.980
Well, well, well!

00:39:24.360 --> 00:39:27.490
You're so elegant I hardly recognized you.

00:39:27.570 --> 00:39:28.820
Whoops!

00:39:29.240 --> 00:39:32.320
And how is the koto lesson going?

00:39:32.410 --> 00:39:36.200
We've only just begun.

00:39:48.800 --> 00:39:51.300
Well, well, well!

00:39:59.020 --> 00:40:03.770
With me, she treats everything
as if it were a game.

00:40:03.850 --> 00:40:07.860
But then instantly,
she does everything perfectly.

00:40:07.940 --> 00:40:09.780
That makes sense.

00:40:10.190 --> 00:40:12.950
She is truly a princess from Heaven.

00:40:13.030 --> 00:40:16.780
She is not one to stay forever
out in the mountains.

00:40:19.250 --> 00:40:25.130
<i>Thus the Princess seemed devoted</i>
<i>to making a noble lady of herself.</i>

00:40:52.110 --> 00:40:53.070
Whoops!

00:40:54.780 --> 00:40:56.570
What's going on here?

00:40:56.660 --> 00:40:59.580
Will you stop doing all this?

00:40:59.660 --> 00:41:03.290
You are now the mother
of a noble princess.

00:41:03.370 --> 00:41:06.420
But this makes me feel at home.

00:41:06.500 --> 00:41:10.170
It's because of you
that the Princess won't...

00:41:14.130 --> 00:41:15.930
Is something the matter?

00:41:17.340 --> 00:41:19.560
You're very quiet.

00:41:19.640 --> 00:41:21.470
Well, Husband...

00:41:30.400 --> 00:41:32.780
Is that true?

00:41:32.860 --> 00:41:33.780
Yes.

00:41:34.820 --> 00:41:38.620
That's wonderful!
We'll have to hold a banquet!

00:41:38.700 --> 00:41:39.830
A banquet?

00:41:39.910 --> 00:41:42.200
To mark your coming of age.

00:41:42.290 --> 00:41:45.210
This is the happiest of occasions!

00:41:45.790 --> 00:41:47.960
So we can invite my friends?

00:41:49.750 --> 00:41:51.590
I miss them so much!

00:41:52.170 --> 00:41:55.670
That might be nice.

00:41:56.260 --> 00:41:57.590
Don't be a fool!

00:41:57.680 --> 00:42:00.970
Do you realize how important this is?

00:42:02.560 --> 00:42:06.560
We live in a different world
to those bumpkins!

00:42:07.600 --> 00:42:10.400
We'll have the naming ceremony
after New Year's.

00:42:10.810 --> 00:42:15.740
After your coming-out banquet,
you'll be a true princess!

00:42:17.150 --> 00:42:18.240
Dad...

00:42:18.320 --> 00:42:21.700
This is wonderful!

00:42:21.780 --> 00:42:25.870
I know! I'll ask Inbe no Akita
to be your Name Father.

00:42:28.580 --> 00:42:30.500
Is anyone here?

00:42:31.040 --> 00:42:33.960
Lady Sagami? Lady Sagami!

00:42:38.630 --> 00:42:39.640
What a bore.

00:43:18.050 --> 00:43:23.600
<i>Birds, bugs, beasts</i>

00:43:24.050 --> 00:43:28.890
<i>Grass, trees, flowers...</i>

00:43:30.520 --> 00:43:34.440
Mom, can I use this piece of the garden?

00:43:34.520 --> 00:43:37.820
-Sorry?
-To plant things I like.

00:43:38.190 --> 00:43:40.740
Why, of course you can.

00:43:40.820 --> 00:43:42.990
Do what you like with it.

00:43:43.410 --> 00:43:45.160
Thanks, Mom.

00:44:07.810 --> 00:44:09.430
No! Never!

00:44:14.480 --> 00:44:17.650
You'll never be a fine princess
looking like that.

00:44:17.980 --> 00:44:20.490
I'll get sweat in my eyes
if you pluck my eyebrows!

00:44:20.570 --> 00:44:25.240
A noble princess does not sweat.

00:44:25.320 --> 00:44:28.540
-Now...
-And blackened teeth just look weird!

00:44:28.830 --> 00:44:30.660
How will I laugh?

00:44:30.910 --> 00:44:34.920
A noble princess
does not open her mouth and laugh.

00:44:35.420 --> 00:44:36.500
That's stupid!

00:44:36.590 --> 00:44:41.470
Even a princess must sweat
and laugh out loud sometimes!

00:44:41.550 --> 00:44:43.090
Or want to cry.

00:44:43.180 --> 00:44:45.010
Or get angry and shout!

00:44:45.390 --> 00:44:47.260
No. A noble princess...

00:44:48.140 --> 00:44:50.890
Then a noble princess isn't human!

00:44:56.520 --> 00:44:57.560
Your Highness!

00:44:57.650 --> 00:45:00.280
The poor thing was tied up!

00:45:04.610 --> 00:45:06.030
Your Highness!

00:45:08.580 --> 00:45:12.000
This way, Lord Akita.

00:45:42.440 --> 00:45:43.360
Your Highness!

00:45:48.700 --> 00:45:52.330
I'm very sorry! She's still very young.

00:45:52.410 --> 00:45:54.000
Not at all.

00:45:54.080 --> 00:45:57.420
She's an adorable little princess.

00:46:01.040 --> 00:46:06.010
She has yet to be made up.
I am truly ashamed.

00:46:06.090 --> 00:46:08.640
Don't give it a second thought.

00:46:08.970 --> 00:46:11.850
To observe her as she really is

00:46:11.930 --> 00:46:16.350
will help me think of an appropriate name.

00:46:16.690 --> 00:46:18.270
I am glad to hear that.

00:46:18.350 --> 00:46:22.980
Please bestow a fine name on our Princess.

00:46:23.940 --> 00:46:28.160
Your Highness, come and greet Lord Akita.

00:46:55.560 --> 00:46:57.640
How do you do, sir?

00:46:59.650 --> 00:47:05.440
Your Highness, let Lord Akita
hear you play on the koto.

00:47:33.220 --> 00:47:35.310
Beautiful!

00:47:37.890 --> 00:47:41.560
The Shining Princess
of the Supple Bamboo...

00:47:43.400 --> 00:47:45.020
The Princess...

00:47:45.110 --> 00:47:46.690
Kaguya?

00:47:46.780 --> 00:47:47.900
Yes.

00:47:47.990 --> 00:47:51.660
A form as graceful as slender bamboo

00:47:51.990 --> 00:47:55.030
and a beauty that shines out from her.

00:47:55.120 --> 00:47:59.450
I give her a name
that means shining light.

00:47:59.960 --> 00:48:03.250
I thus suggest Princess Kaguya.

00:48:03.330 --> 00:48:04.790
Princess Kaguya!

00:48:06.460 --> 00:48:10.630
Lord Akita, you have given her
a truly fine name.

00:48:11.050 --> 00:48:12.930
Thank you very much.

00:48:55.550 --> 00:49:00.140
<i>Following the rites of hair</i>
<i>and trailing skirt,</i>

00:49:00.430 --> 00:49:03.310
<i>guests were invited in great numbers</i>

00:49:03.980 --> 00:49:08.320
<i>to a banquet celebrating</i>
<i>the taking of her name.</i>

00:49:19.160 --> 00:49:21.870
Congratulations!

00:49:21.950 --> 00:49:25.500
Princess Kaguya certainly is a fine name.

00:49:49.520 --> 00:49:52.820
There are so many fine gentlemen here!

00:49:53.990 --> 00:49:58.410
This is a banquet to celebrate
the taking of my name?

00:49:58.490 --> 00:50:00.280
Yes, it is.

00:50:00.620 --> 00:50:04.200
But all I'm doing is sitting.

00:50:04.750 --> 00:50:08.290
I may as well not even be here.

00:50:33.440 --> 00:50:35.440
Thank you very much!

00:50:35.900 --> 00:50:41.280
<i>Princess Kaguya's naming banquet</i>
<i>went on for three days and nights.</i>

00:50:43.080 --> 00:50:47.500
To Princess Kaguya having her hair put up!

00:50:47.620 --> 00:50:51.250
<i>'Tis a fine thing, a fine thing!</i>

00:50:51.670 --> 00:50:55.380
<i>A fine thing, a fine thing!</i>

00:50:55.460 --> 00:50:59.380
<i>A fine thing, a fine thing!</i>

00:50:59.470 --> 00:51:02.970
<i>A fine thing, a fine thing!</i>

00:51:03.050 --> 00:51:06.140
But isn't this all a bit pretentious?

00:51:06.220 --> 00:51:09.390
Your Princess.

00:51:09.480 --> 00:51:12.900
Princess Kaguya, or whoever it is

00:51:12.980 --> 00:51:16.110
enshrined behind that bamboo blind.

00:51:16.400 --> 00:51:20.660
What's wrong with us seeing her
if she's as beautiful as they say?

00:51:21.870 --> 00:51:25.450
No! Anything but that!

00:51:25.540 --> 00:51:30.000
So we come to celebrate
and we can't even say hello?

00:51:30.080 --> 00:51:32.420
That's the custom!

00:51:32.500 --> 00:51:35.750
The custom for noble women, not commoners.

00:51:35.840 --> 00:51:39.380
-Hey!
-She's not even a real princess.

00:51:39.470 --> 00:51:40.760
What?

00:51:40.840 --> 00:51:42.680
She is a princess!

00:51:42.760 --> 00:51:44.100
Please, one moment!

00:51:44.180 --> 00:51:47.970
What did it cost to get her named one?

00:51:48.060 --> 00:51:51.390
At least let us see her!

00:51:51.480 --> 00:51:53.480
Maybe she's ugly!

00:51:53.560 --> 00:51:54.900
What a farce!

00:54:49.110 --> 00:54:50.120
Um...

00:54:51.450 --> 00:54:55.700
would you know what happened to
the people who lived down below?

00:54:56.040 --> 00:54:59.040
I wouldn't know.

00:54:59.920 --> 00:55:04.300
They're on a journey
looking for good trees.

00:55:04.630 --> 00:55:05.670
A journey?

00:55:05.760 --> 00:55:07.920
They won't be back for ten years.

00:55:08.680 --> 00:55:09.760
Ten years?

00:55:10.260 --> 00:55:13.810
Use up all the trees
and you kill the mountain.

00:55:14.510 --> 00:55:18.810
Leave its power and go away,
and it revives.

00:55:19.690 --> 00:55:23.440
Give the trees ten years,
and you can work them again.

00:55:23.940 --> 00:55:25.860
Charcoal is like that, too.

00:55:27.360 --> 00:55:31.820
But what if the mountain really is dead?

00:55:32.200 --> 00:55:34.830
The leaves were so beautiful...

00:55:39.870 --> 00:55:41.750
It's not dead.

00:55:47.380 --> 00:55:48.420
Look.

00:55:49.920 --> 00:55:52.840
The trees are getting ready for spring.

00:55:54.970 --> 00:55:56.260
They are?

00:55:57.350 --> 00:55:58.810
Will spring come back here?

00:55:59.180 --> 00:56:00.640
It will.

00:56:00.980 --> 00:56:06.520
Now the trees are waiting
for it to come round again.

00:56:07.610 --> 00:56:09.240
But who...

00:56:37.100 --> 00:56:40.680
I've seen this before.

00:58:33.920 --> 00:58:37.470
<i>From that day on, Princess Kaguya</i>

00:58:37.550 --> 00:58:42.680
<i>was like a different person,</i>
<i>devoting herself to her studies</i>

00:58:42.760 --> 00:58:46.140
<i>in pensive silence.</i>

00:58:47.770 --> 00:58:49.520
Your Highness!

00:58:55.990 --> 00:58:59.450
Look at all these gifts!

00:58:59.530 --> 00:59:03.740
The nobility has accepted you
as one of their own!

00:59:04.200 --> 00:59:07.410
This is the proof!

00:59:15.000 --> 00:59:17.880
For old times' sake,

00:59:17.970 --> 00:59:21.470
I'll weave you a fine bamboo cage

00:59:21.550 --> 00:59:23.930
for this meadow bunting.

00:59:25.310 --> 00:59:27.680
Thank you, Father.

00:59:34.730 --> 00:59:36.940
Thanks be to Heaven!

00:59:38.440 --> 00:59:40.280
Thanks be to Heaven!

00:59:41.280 --> 00:59:43.490
I'll just leave this here.

00:59:45.830 --> 00:59:47.540
Thank you...

01:00:23.700 --> 01:00:26.740
<i>As word of this great beauty spread,</i>

01:00:26.830 --> 01:00:30.250
<i>huge crowds gathered outside the mansion</i>

01:00:30.790 --> 01:00:34.250
<i>hoping to catch a glimpse</i>
<i>of Princess Kaguya.</i>

01:00:42.470 --> 01:00:44.340
Do you serve Princess Kaguya?

01:00:45.470 --> 01:00:47.260
Then give her this!

01:00:47.680 --> 01:00:49.180
Please!

01:00:49.270 --> 01:00:50.850
And this!

01:00:58.980 --> 01:01:01.650
There's another crowd
of gentlemen outside.

01:01:03.700 --> 01:01:08.530
They've given me
all these letters for you.

01:01:09.450 --> 01:01:12.790
And I brought you some cherry blossoms

01:01:12.870 --> 01:01:16.710
because you can't go out
with that crowd outside.

01:01:18.380 --> 01:01:19.380
Thank you!

01:01:49.910 --> 01:01:53.200
You summoned me, Prince lshitsukuri?

01:01:57.380 --> 01:02:00.670
About that rich upstart's daughter
that you named...

01:02:00.750 --> 01:02:03.300
You mean Princess Kaguya?

01:02:03.760 --> 01:02:05.220
Keep your voice down!

01:02:05.300 --> 01:02:07.300
Did you say, "Princess Kaguya"?

01:02:07.760 --> 01:02:12.010
Princess Kaguya?
I've heard the gossip about her.

01:02:12.100 --> 01:02:14.310
They say she's very beautiful.

01:02:14.980 --> 01:02:17.060
You would shout, wouldn't you?

01:02:17.600 --> 01:02:21.020
Beautiful she may be,
but she is of humble birth.

01:02:21.110 --> 01:02:24.190
She is not a woman for any of us.

01:02:24.280 --> 01:02:29.570
Princess Kaguya is a presumptuous name

01:02:29.660 --> 01:02:32.580
for a daughter of the likes of Miyatsuko.

01:02:32.870 --> 01:02:34.370
No, Minister.

01:02:35.160 --> 01:02:38.920
She is not his true daughter.

01:02:39.000 --> 01:02:41.420
She was born from a bamboo stalk.

01:02:41.500 --> 01:02:42.840
A bamboo stalk?

01:02:43.210 --> 01:02:46.590
How interesting.
So she's a woodland spirit?

01:02:47.010 --> 01:02:51.100
That is not entirely impossible,
Lord Counselor.

01:02:51.510 --> 01:02:52.350
What?

01:02:52.680 --> 01:02:56.890
The moment I stood before her,

01:02:57.270 --> 01:03:00.730
my aged body began to tremble

01:03:00.810 --> 01:03:04.230
as if a dry fountain
had come back to life.

01:03:05.110 --> 01:03:09.990
Just the memory of that glimmering beauty

01:03:10.280 --> 01:03:14.950
leaves me completely lost for words!

01:03:24.250 --> 01:03:25.340
Stand aside!

01:03:35.060 --> 01:03:36.600
I will win this race!

01:03:37.060 --> 01:03:39.100
I will be first!

01:03:39.190 --> 01:03:42.520
That glimmering beauty will be mine!

01:03:42.610 --> 01:03:45.020
I will have her!

01:03:45.110 --> 01:03:47.070
I go to meet my wife!

01:03:56.740 --> 01:03:59.500
Lady Sagami!

01:04:00.410 --> 01:04:01.330
What is it?

01:04:01.620 --> 01:04:03.420
Look at these!

01:04:03.670 --> 01:04:07.420
Five of the land's
highest-born men have come

01:04:07.880 --> 01:04:09.760
and in formal dress!

01:04:09.840 --> 01:04:10.760
Oh, my!

01:04:11.340 --> 01:04:13.640
Thanks be to Heaven!

01:04:13.720 --> 01:04:16.260
A minister, two princes...

01:04:16.640 --> 01:04:20.430
But how will we choose among them?

01:04:20.810 --> 01:04:25.150
They're all here together,
awaiting an answer.

01:04:25.230 --> 01:04:28.360
I understand. Leave the princess to me.

01:04:28.440 --> 01:04:31.070
You go and entertain them.

01:04:31.150 --> 01:04:32.410
I will!

01:04:32.490 --> 01:04:34.950
Thank you very much!

01:04:37.030 --> 01:04:38.950
Thanks be to Heaven!

01:04:39.040 --> 01:04:42.460
That banquet was worth
every penny I spent on it!

01:04:44.210 --> 01:04:46.710
They are all of the highest rank.

01:04:46.920 --> 01:04:50.090
You will not go wrong with any of them.

01:04:50.170 --> 01:04:53.510
So, Your Highness,
choose the one you wish.

01:04:54.090 --> 01:04:55.930
Even though I don't know them?

01:04:56.430 --> 01:04:57.600
Of course.

01:04:57.680 --> 01:05:03.690
A gentleman makes a proposal,
and you meet on your wedding day.

01:05:04.440 --> 01:05:08.480
With your choice of these five nobles,

01:05:08.730 --> 01:05:11.610
how happy you will be!

01:05:12.240 --> 01:05:13.700
Happy?

01:05:15.950 --> 01:05:18.780
I have no wish to marry anyone yet.

01:05:18.870 --> 01:05:20.410
You can't mean that!

01:05:20.490 --> 01:05:25.290
You must marry a suitable gentleman
as soon as possible.

01:05:25.540 --> 01:05:27.960
That is happiness itself.

01:05:28.170 --> 01:05:29.710
Why would you hesitate?

01:05:30.000 --> 01:05:34.090
With any of those men,
your happiness is assured.

01:05:34.180 --> 01:05:36.180
I will not choose any of them!

01:05:36.260 --> 01:05:38.350
Please ask them to leave.

01:05:41.060 --> 01:05:44.100
Do you wish to hurt your father?

01:05:45.310 --> 01:05:49.360
He is as glad for you
as he would be for himself.

01:06:01.040 --> 01:06:05.790
All has been made ready.
If you would come this way...

01:06:30.940 --> 01:06:35.070
Now, if you would each speak
in order of precedence.

01:06:36.950 --> 01:06:40.120
I am Prince Kuramochi.

01:06:40.200 --> 01:06:41.330
Princess...

01:06:42.240 --> 01:06:44.580
my feelings toward you are

01:06:44.660 --> 01:06:48.290
as I wrote in my letter.

01:06:49.500 --> 01:06:55.460
If it came to pass
that you became my wife,

01:06:55.760 --> 01:07:00.850
my joy would be as if I had found
a jeweled branch from a tree

01:07:00.930 --> 01:07:03.220
of Mount Penglai in China,

01:07:03.310 --> 01:07:06.430
with silver roots,
gold trunk, and pearls for fruit.

01:07:06.680 --> 01:07:12.360
To me, you are a treasure
as unattainable as that.

01:07:12.440 --> 01:07:14.730
-If you would--
-I am Prince lshitsukuri.

01:07:15.070 --> 01:07:17.740
If you consent to be my wife,

01:07:17.820 --> 01:07:22.070
l will worship you day and night,
my forehead to the ground,

01:07:22.160 --> 01:07:27.000
as I would the stone begging bowl
of Lord Buddha himself in India.

01:07:27.080 --> 01:07:30.580
You would treat her
as a piece of cold stone?

01:07:31.540 --> 01:07:35.000
To me, you are as a robe of fire-rat fur.

01:07:35.090 --> 01:07:38.800
Put in the flames,
all impurities burn away,

01:07:38.880 --> 01:07:42.050
but it is not consumed,
and merely glistens

01:07:42.140 --> 01:07:43.890
all the brighter.

01:07:44.350 --> 01:07:47.350
You are as pure as

01:07:47.430 --> 01:07:50.690
this rare treasure of China.

01:07:50.770 --> 01:07:55.020
You compare Princess Kaguya to a rat-skin?

01:07:55.110 --> 01:07:57.360
To me, Princess,

01:07:57.440 --> 01:08:01.700
you are a jewel
that glistens more radiantly

01:08:01.780 --> 01:08:06.790
than the five-colored stone
that shines from the dragon's neck!

01:08:06.870 --> 01:08:10.160
No! To me, Princess Kaguya

01:08:10.250 --> 01:08:15.540
is like the cowrie shell
the swallow warms as a treasure

01:08:15.630 --> 01:08:20.090
and a charm for safe birth.

01:08:20.510 --> 01:08:21.550
A treasure...

01:08:21.630 --> 01:08:25.850
A cowrie shell is a treasure?
It is laughable!

01:08:26.510 --> 01:08:29.390
Well, a dragon's neck stinks!

01:08:29.980 --> 01:08:31.480
It's the jewel on the neck!

01:08:55.630 --> 01:08:58.380
What a beautiful melody!

01:08:59.380 --> 01:09:03.260
I am grateful for these sentiments
toward someone

01:09:04.680 --> 01:09:07.390
you have neither met nor seen.

01:09:08.850 --> 01:09:09.720
I ask...

01:09:12.100 --> 01:09:14.730
that you bring me

01:09:15.400 --> 01:09:18.230
these rare treasures of which you speak.

01:09:19.440 --> 01:09:24.700
Then I will be able
to feel clearly in my heart

01:09:24.950 --> 01:09:27.620
how you treasure me.

01:09:28.870 --> 01:09:33.410
Prince Kuramochi, bring me
the jeweled branch of Penglai.

01:09:33.830 --> 01:09:37.420
Prince lshitsukuri,
Lord Buddha's stone bowl.

01:09:37.500 --> 01:09:38.540
But that's...

01:09:38.630 --> 01:09:43.300
Lord Minister of the Right Abe,
bring a robe of fire-rat fur.

01:09:43.380 --> 01:09:44.380
What?

01:09:44.470 --> 01:09:49.430
Grand Counselor Otomo,
the jewel from the dragon's neck.

01:09:50.220 --> 01:09:53.180
And Middle Counselor lsonokami,

01:09:53.270 --> 01:09:56.350
the swallow's cowrie shell.

01:09:56.440 --> 01:09:57.610
Impossible!

01:09:57.690 --> 01:09:59.270
No, no, no...

01:09:59.360 --> 01:10:02.940
These things may not even exist!

01:10:03.030 --> 01:10:06.200
They were only figures of speech!

01:10:06.570 --> 01:10:07.530
Yes.

01:10:08.030 --> 01:10:13.450
You have all compared me
to very rare treasures.

01:10:13.790 --> 01:10:17.630
If I can obtain one of them,

01:10:18.460 --> 01:10:22.550
l will happily become
that gentleman's treasure.

01:10:24.470 --> 01:10:27.090
Gentlemen, I apologize!

01:10:27.180 --> 01:10:29.640
She knows nothing of the world.

01:10:29.890 --> 01:10:34.230
But she must be beautiful.
Her voice, her music...

01:10:34.310 --> 01:10:37.770
Indeed! That melody was
quite out of this world.

01:10:38.190 --> 01:10:41.980
But to set us these impossible tasks...

01:10:42.360 --> 01:10:44.530
Out of the question!

01:10:44.610 --> 01:10:47.530
She is truly an unattainable treasure.

01:10:54.410 --> 01:10:55.540
It's terrible!

01:10:56.040 --> 01:11:00.040
When the nobles left,
so did everyone else outside!

01:11:00.380 --> 01:11:03.050
Just like the tide going out?

01:11:03.420 --> 01:11:04.460
Yes.

01:11:04.550 --> 01:11:06.420
I thought I should tell you.

01:11:09.180 --> 01:11:10.430
Your Highness!

01:11:15.220 --> 01:11:16.310
Let's go!

01:11:16.390 --> 01:11:17.730
Where?

01:11:17.810 --> 01:11:19.900
-Out!
-Out?

01:11:19.980 --> 01:11:21.650
To see the cherry blossoms!

01:11:22.270 --> 01:11:25.990
Ask Father and Mother to come, too!

01:11:27.740 --> 01:11:30.610
There is nothing more I can do.

01:11:30.700 --> 01:11:32.660
Yes, but surely...

01:11:33.200 --> 01:11:36.080
Next time the Princess will...

01:11:36.160 --> 01:11:38.960
There will be no next time.

01:11:39.420 --> 01:11:43.380
I will take my leave of you.

01:11:43.790 --> 01:11:45.630
But...

01:11:49.680 --> 01:11:53.720
The carriage the Princess
requested awaits, Squire.

01:11:53.800 --> 01:11:56.140
Tell them to go without me!

01:12:54.530 --> 01:12:55.620
Oh, my!

01:13:04.830 --> 01:13:06.040
It's beautiful!

01:13:09.880 --> 01:13:11.010
Stop!

01:13:16.260 --> 01:13:17.260
Your Highness?

01:13:38.330 --> 01:13:39.990
How wonderful!

01:14:26.170 --> 01:14:28.250
I'm very sorry, Milady.

01:14:31.840 --> 01:14:33.960
Please forgive us!

01:14:40.140 --> 01:14:41.010
Come on.

01:14:55.820 --> 01:14:58.410
They're right at their peak.

01:14:58.490 --> 01:15:00.990
Yes, they're beautiful.

01:15:08.120 --> 01:15:09.210
Let's go home.

01:16:00.970 --> 01:16:03.680
Something's happened up ahead.

01:16:04.050 --> 01:16:05.680
Someone's coming.

01:16:05.760 --> 01:16:07.680
-Sutemaru!
-Run!

01:16:07.770 --> 01:16:08.930
Sutemaru?

01:16:19.150 --> 01:16:20.450
Sutemaru!

01:16:22.410 --> 01:16:23.370
Sutemaru!

01:16:36.630 --> 01:16:37.670
What's wrong?

01:16:38.010 --> 01:16:39.380
They'll catch us!

01:16:41.550 --> 01:16:42.590
We're going!

01:16:55.400 --> 01:16:56.570
Li'l Bamboo!

01:17:14.420 --> 01:17:15.960
Sutemaru!

01:17:17.290 --> 01:17:20.210
Sutemaru!

01:17:21.170 --> 01:17:22.760
Sutemaru!

01:17:24.430 --> 01:17:25.970
Sutemaru!

01:17:30.810 --> 01:17:31.640
Come on.

01:18:05.090 --> 01:18:09.180
<i>Three years went by.</i>

01:18:53.890 --> 01:18:54.810
Off you go.

01:19:07.490 --> 01:19:11.830
Isn't it a lovely day?
Look how the garden has grown.

01:19:12.160 --> 01:19:14.040
Yes, but you know...

01:19:16.120 --> 01:19:19.460
it all looks different
when you see it from here.

01:19:27.170 --> 01:19:28.090
Well!

01:19:33.100 --> 01:19:35.270
It's like the mountain at home.

01:19:35.350 --> 01:19:36.680
You're right.

01:19:37.020 --> 01:19:39.810
There's the forest, and the hill...

01:19:40.150 --> 01:19:42.480
And there's our house.

01:19:42.560 --> 01:19:45.480
And the grass is the bamboo grove.

01:19:45.570 --> 01:19:48.110
The mugwort looks just like trees.

01:19:48.490 --> 01:19:52.070
You can almost see the moon
rising behind the mountain.

01:19:52.320 --> 01:19:55.620
And we could go over the bridge
and up the hill--

01:19:55.990 --> 01:19:57.040
Princess!

01:19:57.620 --> 01:19:59.960
Where is Her Highness?

01:20:00.870 --> 01:20:02.250
You're here again?

01:20:02.330 --> 01:20:04.000
What's wrong with it?

01:20:04.090 --> 01:20:05.630
You're here all the time!

01:20:05.710 --> 01:20:07.670
Anyway, not now.

01:20:08.380 --> 01:20:09.420
The Prince!

01:20:09.510 --> 01:20:13.640
Prince Kuramochi has brought
the jeweled branch of Penglai!

01:20:14.640 --> 01:20:15.640
Impossible!

01:20:15.930 --> 01:20:19.180
It's hard to believe,
but he is true to his word.

01:20:19.270 --> 01:20:23.060
You'd think he'd be angry
with a task like that,

01:20:23.150 --> 01:20:27.860
but he really has brought back
a jeweled branch!

01:20:28.780 --> 01:20:33.110
Your Highness, go and get ready
for your wedding!

01:20:33.200 --> 01:20:34.740
I should hurry!

01:20:34.830 --> 01:20:38.200
The two of them will need a bedchamber!

01:20:40.210 --> 01:20:44.000
If only Lady Sagami were here!

01:20:45.920 --> 01:20:47.210
This can't be right!

01:20:48.340 --> 01:20:49.880
A bedchamber...

01:20:53.390 --> 01:20:54.470
Princess Kaguya!

01:20:54.850 --> 01:20:57.100
Where is Princess Kaguya?

01:20:57.180 --> 01:20:59.470
Please wait, Your Highness!

01:21:02.310 --> 01:21:04.100
Squire Miyatsuko!

01:21:04.480 --> 01:21:06.440
Forgive me.

01:21:06.520 --> 01:21:09.030
I was in such a rush to get here

01:21:09.110 --> 01:21:11.780
that I didn't change my clothes.

01:21:11.860 --> 01:21:16.200
Oh, this is wonderful!
Thanks be to Heaven!

01:21:16.530 --> 01:21:18.490
Please, this way.

01:21:21.450 --> 01:21:22.540
Come in.

01:21:40.100 --> 01:21:43.980
Without further ado,
I will show what I promised to bring.

01:22:03.290 --> 01:22:06.790
It's so beautiful it dazzles the eye!

01:22:06.880 --> 01:22:11.420
As you wished,
the jeweled branch of Penglai.

01:22:12.170 --> 01:22:15.430
Princess Kaguya, are you in there?

01:22:16.010 --> 01:22:19.640
Come near and take a good look.

01:22:19.720 --> 01:22:21.140
One moment.

01:22:21.810 --> 01:22:27.690
First, allow me to ask how you came by it.

01:22:28.360 --> 01:22:30.360
Of course!

01:22:47.920 --> 01:22:51.340
Three years ago,
I vowed to carry out your wish.

01:22:51.630 --> 01:22:53.590
I boarded a ship

01:22:53.670 --> 01:22:57.680
and we set course for Mount Penglai.

01:22:58.180 --> 01:23:00.510
Tossed by angry waves

01:23:00.600 --> 01:23:03.560
and starving for lack of food

01:23:03.640 --> 01:23:07.230
after all manner
of trials and tribulations.

01:23:09.020 --> 01:23:09.940
Behold!

01:23:10.190 --> 01:23:15.650
What is that mountain,
so beautiful yet forbidding?

01:23:16.860 --> 01:23:18.320
Amazing!

01:23:18.950 --> 01:23:22.700
It flows with water of gold,
silver, and lapis lazuli!

01:23:23.160 --> 01:23:24.080
Look!

01:23:24.700 --> 01:23:27.710
A celestial maiden draws water
with a silver bowl!

01:23:28.870 --> 01:23:30.170
Hello!

01:23:30.880 --> 01:23:33.420
What is the name of this mountain?

01:23:35.050 --> 01:23:37.800
This is Mount Penglai.

01:23:38.630 --> 01:23:42.390
And my name is Ukanruri.

01:23:44.140 --> 01:23:48.440
At last, I had made my way
to Mount Penglai!

01:23:49.600 --> 01:23:54.570
Without a second glance at the maiden,
I climbed the mountain.

01:23:56.030 --> 01:23:58.950
Look at those beautiful trees!

01:23:59.610 --> 01:24:04.780
Silver branches, trunks of gold,
and fruit of pearls!

01:24:04.870 --> 01:24:07.580
How beautiful!

01:24:07.950 --> 01:24:12.330
Are these not
the very jeweled branches of Penglai

01:24:12.420 --> 01:24:15.420
Princess Kaguya said she wished for?

01:24:16.710 --> 01:24:21.510
This is the branch I snapped off then.

01:24:29.680 --> 01:24:32.100
Seeing is believing.

01:24:32.310 --> 01:24:35.360
Look upon it with your own eyes.

01:24:44.120 --> 01:24:47.540
-No! You can't do this!
-Get out of my way!

01:24:49.410 --> 01:24:51.410
What is the meaning of this?

01:24:51.500 --> 01:24:54.540
I most humbly apologize. I'll go and see.

01:24:54.630 --> 01:24:56.380
I must get this to her.

01:24:57.380 --> 01:24:58.920
Move aside!

01:24:59.670 --> 01:25:02.220
At least read this letter!

01:25:02.300 --> 01:25:03.430
What's going on?

01:25:04.390 --> 01:25:08.310
Pay us our fee
for the jeweled branch we made!

01:25:08.390 --> 01:25:09.310
What?

01:25:10.390 --> 01:25:11.560
Made?

01:25:13.440 --> 01:25:18.690
I am Ayabe no Uchimaro,
of the Guild of Artisans.

01:25:19.730 --> 01:25:24.570
Prince Kuramochi had us mount gems

01:25:25.070 --> 01:25:28.080
and fashion them into a jeweled branch.

01:25:28.660 --> 01:25:29.580
What?

01:25:29.950 --> 01:25:33.080
The Prince, however, has not yet paid us.

01:25:33.460 --> 01:25:34.460
What?

01:25:35.130 --> 01:25:36.460
Oh, dear!

01:25:36.710 --> 01:25:41.590
And since Princess Kaguya,
one of his concubines,

01:25:42.170 --> 01:25:46.260
sorry, his wife, is here in this house,

01:25:46.340 --> 01:25:48.890
we had no choice,

01:25:48.970 --> 01:25:52.850
but to come here and ask her for payment.

01:25:57.230 --> 01:25:58.360
I see.

01:25:59.570 --> 01:26:01.990
Your Highness, what is the...

01:26:03.820 --> 01:26:06.490
Your Highness? Where did he go?

01:26:07.660 --> 01:26:08.870
Where's the branch?

01:26:09.410 --> 01:26:12.250
His Highness has taken his leave.

01:26:12.330 --> 01:26:13.500
What?

01:26:20.630 --> 01:26:25.430
Please reward the artisans very well.

01:26:31.140 --> 01:26:32.140
There!

01:26:33.430 --> 01:26:38.440
<i>Next to call at the mansion</i>
<i>was Abe, Minister of the Right.</i>

01:26:48.910 --> 01:26:50.240
Look!

01:26:50.620 --> 01:26:53.240
See how it glistens!

01:26:55.580 --> 01:27:01.500
The world has never seen
such an expensive engagement gift.

01:27:02.090 --> 01:27:05.920
But if it should please Princess Kaguya,

01:27:06.010 --> 01:27:09.050
it is a mere trifle.

01:27:10.680 --> 01:27:11.850
In that case...

01:27:11.930 --> 01:27:14.310
Ah, you're right there?

01:27:14.390 --> 01:27:16.140
Put it into a fire.

01:27:16.230 --> 01:27:17.100
Huh?

01:27:18.350 --> 01:27:19.520
What?

01:27:21.190 --> 01:27:23.650
If it is truly the fur of the fire rat,

01:27:24.320 --> 01:27:28.860
it will not burn,
but merely glisten all the brighter.

01:27:28.950 --> 01:27:30.620
Of course!

01:27:30.700 --> 01:27:34.080
This robe is the genuine article!

01:27:34.290 --> 01:27:36.960
Placed in the fire, it will not burn.

01:27:37.660 --> 01:27:40.830
Or at least, it should not burn.

01:27:40.920 --> 01:27:45.210
Unless, of course,
between myself and the Princess,

01:27:45.300 --> 01:27:49.510
there remains some unwarranted impurity.

01:27:49.880 --> 01:27:51.510
Yes, indeed.

01:27:51.590 --> 01:27:54.680
All the more reason to test it.

01:27:54.760 --> 01:27:59.270
Burn away all the impurity of my doubts.

01:28:02.860 --> 01:28:04.270
Oh, all right!

01:28:45.520 --> 01:28:47.230
What did I tell you?

01:28:47.480 --> 01:28:48.610
You see?

01:29:04.000 --> 01:29:07.300
My fortune is burning!

01:29:17.010 --> 01:29:20.310
I've lost everything!

01:29:29.230 --> 01:29:31.900
Do you realize how much this cost?

01:29:32.280 --> 01:29:35.280
Look at it, will you?

01:29:35.370 --> 01:29:38.120
Burn it, she says!

01:29:40.830 --> 01:29:42.370
How infuriating!

01:29:50.050 --> 01:29:52.840
I wonder how much the Minister

01:29:52.920 --> 01:29:56.260
spent on that fake.

01:29:56.340 --> 01:29:59.510
I assume that is what I am
to those gentlemen.

01:30:00.600 --> 01:30:05.020
A fake jeweled branch,
or a rat-fur robe that burns.

01:30:06.730 --> 01:30:09.980
Both those objects were very expensive.

01:30:10.530 --> 01:30:12.900
But don't worry.

01:30:12.990 --> 01:30:16.910
Grand Counselor Otomo
has indeed put to sea

01:30:16.990 --> 01:30:21.410
in quest of the gem
hanging from the dragon's neck.

01:30:22.250 --> 01:30:27.000
They say that in order to marry you,

01:30:27.080 --> 01:30:29.340
he has sent his wife away

01:30:29.420 --> 01:30:32.670
and completely rebuilt his mansion.

01:30:33.590 --> 01:30:37.180
A warrior's resolve is a wondrous thing.

01:30:42.010 --> 01:30:44.680
All right, Dragon! Have at me!

01:30:49.940 --> 01:30:51.020
Careful!

01:31:14.920 --> 01:31:16.260
The Dragon!

01:31:17.880 --> 01:31:21.050
Forgive me!

01:31:33.020 --> 01:31:35.230
Another one!

01:31:37.150 --> 01:31:38.570
Help me!

01:31:38.650 --> 01:31:42.070
Calm down! The storm will blow itself out.

01:31:52.420 --> 01:31:55.920
<i>About that time, Prince lshitsukuri</i>

01:31:56.010 --> 01:31:58.930
<i>was having an audience with the Princess.</i>

01:32:19.030 --> 01:32:21.820
Well, Your Highness,

01:32:21.910 --> 01:32:24.870
is this Lord Buddha's stone bowl?

01:32:25.240 --> 01:32:27.370
Give this to her.

01:32:27.660 --> 01:32:30.160
What is it exactly?

01:32:30.250 --> 01:32:32.290
Give it to her, please.

01:32:32.380 --> 01:32:35.290
Yes, but...

01:32:41.180 --> 01:32:45.600
Your Highness,
this is from Prince lshitsukuri.

01:33:01.320 --> 01:33:04.950
Since I first heard your voice
three years ago,

01:33:05.030 --> 01:33:07.830
you have been constantly on my mind.

01:33:08.410 --> 01:33:12.960
Desperately, I searched for
Buddha's stone begging bowl.

01:33:13.960 --> 01:33:18.210
I crossed meadow and mountain,
visiting every temple in the land.

01:33:19.170 --> 01:33:23.470
Eventually, weary as could be,
I sat on a rock by the roadside.

01:33:25.090 --> 01:33:30.560
Suddenly, my eye fell upon
a wildflower, there at my feet.

01:33:31.430 --> 01:33:36.900
Ah! My feelings for you
bloomed unknown, I thought,

01:33:36.980 --> 01:33:39.280
just like that flower.

01:33:40.740 --> 01:33:44.990
Suddenly, the realization dawned

01:33:46.070 --> 01:33:48.740
that what I wanted to give you,

01:33:49.080 --> 01:33:52.370
and you wanted to receive,

01:33:52.910 --> 01:33:56.880
was not some unattainable treasure,
but that flower.

01:33:57.420 --> 01:34:02.130
In other words,
the symbol of my devotion to you.

01:34:03.220 --> 01:34:04.340
Devotion...

01:34:05.720 --> 01:34:08.680
Princess Kaguya! You are the one

01:34:09.060 --> 01:34:12.180
to whom I would give my heart.

01:34:12.810 --> 01:34:16.980
Would you accept that lovely flower

01:34:17.060 --> 01:34:18.900
and my devotion?

01:34:22.030 --> 01:34:25.200
I have always loved plants.

01:34:25.610 --> 01:34:31.200
I am entranced by the nameless flowers
that grow by the roadside.

01:34:31.870 --> 01:34:34.410
And I always wish

01:34:35.000 --> 01:34:38.710
l could live as one of those
flowers in the field.

01:34:44.800 --> 01:34:50.010
Princess, come with me
to some place that is not this one.

01:34:51.010 --> 01:34:54.480
Let us leave the capital
and its formalities

01:34:55.310 --> 01:34:59.810
for a rich green land of flowers,
birds, and leaping fish.

01:35:00.480 --> 01:35:01.980
Somewhere not here.

01:35:04.110 --> 01:35:09.280
We will laugh, sing, and sleep
to our hearts' content.

01:35:10.030 --> 01:35:13.790
Morning to night,
the seasons meeting our needs,

01:35:13.870 --> 01:35:16.620
let us spin a beautiful tale.

01:35:18.500 --> 01:35:22.800
Come with me
to somewhere that is not here!

01:35:23.340 --> 01:35:26.220
A land of green where flowers bloom,

01:35:26.300 --> 01:35:29.340
birds sing, and fish dance!

01:35:29.430 --> 01:35:32.050
Somewhere that is not here!

01:35:42.570 --> 01:35:44.530
What?

01:35:45.860 --> 01:35:49.200
Somewhere that is not here?

01:35:49.530 --> 01:35:54.120
I would very much like
to be taken there again.

01:35:54.200 --> 01:35:56.330
I'm sorry!

01:35:56.620 --> 01:35:58.210
Forgive me!

01:36:02.130 --> 01:36:04.920
How many flowers

01:36:05.000 --> 01:36:10.050
have you plucked and thrown away,

01:36:10.130 --> 01:36:14.220
leaving them
to shave their heads in despair

01:36:14.310 --> 01:36:17.520
and become nuns?

01:36:22.150 --> 01:36:23.810
I've found one!

01:36:25.110 --> 01:36:26.860
Get me down!

01:36:26.940 --> 01:36:27.860
<i>Remaining now,</i>

01:36:28.280 --> 01:36:33.320
<i>was Middle Counselor lsonokami,</i>
<i>and the swallow's cowrie shell.</i>

01:36:36.830 --> 01:36:37.950
Counselor!

01:36:38.040 --> 01:36:40.830
Is he all right?

01:36:46.710 --> 01:36:47.960
He's dead?

01:36:48.300 --> 01:36:49.260
Yes.

01:36:49.340 --> 01:36:53.590
The fall broke the Middle Counselor's hip,
which led to his death.

01:37:19.330 --> 01:37:20.660
What's wrong?

01:37:21.910 --> 01:37:24.670
This garden! It's a fake!

01:37:27.090 --> 01:37:28.130
Fake!

01:37:28.420 --> 01:37:30.630
Fake!

01:37:31.170 --> 01:37:32.380
Fake!

01:37:32.800 --> 01:37:34.050
All of it! Fake!

01:37:34.590 --> 01:37:37.640
And so am I!

01:37:37.720 --> 01:37:38.680
Stop it.

01:37:47.900 --> 01:37:50.780
It's my fault everyone's miserable.

01:37:51.650 --> 01:37:55.030
It's not your fault. It's not.

01:37:55.610 --> 01:37:58.490
It is my fault.

01:37:59.580 --> 01:38:01.500
Because I'm a fake!

01:38:02.620 --> 01:38:03.500
Princess!

01:38:03.580 --> 01:38:07.670
I never dreamed
things would turn out like this!

01:38:07.750 --> 01:38:08.840
Of course not.

01:38:09.710 --> 01:38:12.630
But it's not your fault.

01:38:23.180 --> 01:38:26.440
<i>Now, in spite of her wishes,</i>

01:38:26.520 --> 01:38:28.900
<i>there was even more talk of her.</i>

01:38:29.230 --> 01:38:33.150
<i>The Emperor himself became interested.</i>

01:38:35.990 --> 01:38:39.330
She has toyed with
five of the greatest nobles.

01:38:40.280 --> 01:38:41.450
Fascinating.

01:38:42.040 --> 01:38:44.120
That must mean

01:38:44.200 --> 01:38:49.380
this Princess Kaguya wishes to come to me.

01:38:51.420 --> 01:38:54.840
Send word that she is to come
and serve at court.

01:38:55.220 --> 01:38:56.470
Yes, Sire.

01:38:56.930 --> 01:39:01.640
If she comes, I'll give her father,
Sanuki no Miyatsuko,

01:39:02.010 --> 01:39:03.770
a court rank!

01:39:04.480 --> 01:39:05.930
Yes, Sire.

01:39:06.600 --> 01:39:08.270
Thanks be to Heaven!

01:39:08.730 --> 01:39:10.690
Your Highness!

01:39:10.770 --> 01:39:12.730
Please! No more of this!

01:39:12.820 --> 01:39:13.690
Your Highness!

01:39:16.950 --> 01:39:19.740
Your Highness! Rejoice!

01:39:20.530 --> 01:39:25.000
His Majesty summons you
to serve him at court!

01:39:26.040 --> 01:39:29.080
You'll be one of his ladies.

01:39:29.170 --> 01:39:31.880
And I'll wear a courtier's cap!

01:39:31.960 --> 01:39:34.300
Thanks be to Heaven!

01:39:34.380 --> 01:39:37.380
You still don't understand how she feels?

01:39:37.470 --> 01:39:39.220
It's you who doesn't understand!

01:39:39.470 --> 01:39:41.800
This is what I've worked for!

01:39:42.300 --> 01:39:44.140
A court lady!

01:39:44.220 --> 01:39:48.100
There is no greater happiness
for a girl in this land!

01:39:49.140 --> 01:39:53.020
At last, the Princess will be happy!

01:39:53.110 --> 01:39:54.150
Father...

01:39:54.820 --> 01:39:57.740
I'm sorry, but please refuse.

01:39:58.610 --> 01:40:00.700
I can't be His Majesty's lady now.

01:40:01.620 --> 01:40:05.290
What? This is for your sake--

01:40:05.620 --> 01:40:07.160
Tell him no.

01:40:08.250 --> 01:40:09.500
But...

01:40:09.870 --> 01:40:14.500
no one in this land may disobey
an order from His Majesty!

01:40:14.590 --> 01:40:17.510
Now, please! Don't be so contrary!

01:40:19.090 --> 01:40:23.390
If you wish to accuse me

01:40:23.970 --> 01:40:26.770
of disobedience to His Majesty,

01:40:28.270 --> 01:40:31.560
then feel free to kill me.

01:40:32.150 --> 01:40:33.190
Princess!

01:40:33.270 --> 01:40:37.070
If your happiness

01:40:37.480 --> 01:40:39.570
depends on a courtier's cap,

01:40:40.740 --> 01:40:43.200
then I will go to him.

01:40:44.200 --> 01:40:49.040
When I see you wearing that cap,
then I will die.

01:41:03.050 --> 01:41:06.140
What? She refuses?

01:41:06.850 --> 01:41:08.180
What can this mean?

01:41:08.720 --> 01:41:13.150
I never dreamed a woman
would ever turn me down.

01:41:15.520 --> 01:41:19.150
Fascinating.
I wish to meet her all the more.

01:41:20.150 --> 01:41:25.490
In that case, I'll pay a quiet visit
to the Miyatsuko mansion.

01:41:26.580 --> 01:41:27.990
Yes, Sire.

01:41:45.180 --> 01:41:46.800
This way, please.

01:41:51.850 --> 01:41:54.100
She plays wonderfully.

01:42:15.870 --> 01:42:17.710
How beautiful!

01:42:30.510 --> 01:42:34.230
Come with me to the palace.

01:42:34.310 --> 01:42:36.270
Why are you doing this?

01:42:36.350 --> 01:42:40.320
No woman is unhappy when I do this.

01:42:40.400 --> 01:42:42.940
I will never be yours!

01:42:43.030 --> 01:42:47.780
You must be, if I wish it.

01:42:49.070 --> 01:42:50.780
Bring the palanquin!

01:42:57.080 --> 01:42:58.000
What?

01:42:58.580 --> 01:42:59.500
Where are you?

01:43:06.050 --> 01:43:07.090
Where did you go?

01:43:27.490 --> 01:43:32.700
I apologize for acting in haste.
Please show yourself.

01:43:34.290 --> 01:43:35.160
Please.

01:43:36.290 --> 01:43:39.750
I will burn the sight of you
into my eyes and leave.

01:43:50.010 --> 01:43:51.680
How beautiful!

01:43:55.100 --> 01:43:56.430
Forgive me.

01:44:01.810 --> 01:44:03.400
I will withdraw.

01:44:03.940 --> 01:44:06.940
But I still believe

01:44:07.400 --> 01:44:09.910
that your happiness lies in being mine.

01:44:12.700 --> 01:44:14.490
Beautiful!

01:44:43.480 --> 01:44:46.110
<i>His Majesty returned to his palace.</i>

01:44:47.070 --> 01:44:51.280
<i>Now, every night that the moon was out,</i>

01:44:51.360 --> 01:44:53.870
<i>the Princess would gaze up at it.</i>

01:45:14.970 --> 01:45:16.640
What's wrong?

01:45:17.560 --> 01:45:19.980
Lately, you haven't come to see me.

01:45:21.890 --> 01:45:26.980
You've left your weaving to sit,
and your garden to grow wild.

01:45:27.520 --> 01:45:30.610
You sit every night and gaze at the moon.

01:45:30.690 --> 01:45:33.200
What's the matter?

01:45:33.740 --> 01:45:35.070
Nothing.

01:45:35.320 --> 01:45:37.950
It's something.

01:45:38.450 --> 01:45:41.500
I can tell by the look in your eyes.

01:45:42.370 --> 01:45:44.580
There's really nothing wrong.

01:45:44.830 --> 01:45:46.460
That's not true.

01:45:54.220 --> 01:45:57.050
Can't you tell even me?

01:46:03.850 --> 01:46:06.810
I don't want to go back to the Moon!

01:46:07.980 --> 01:46:08.940
Go back?

01:46:09.940 --> 01:46:10.980
To the Moon?

01:46:11.190 --> 01:46:15.490
I've begged them to let me stay!

01:46:15.780 --> 01:46:18.160
Here! In this land!

01:46:19.120 --> 01:46:23.040
But they're coming for me
on the 15th night!

01:46:23.710 --> 01:46:24.830
Coming for you?

01:46:26.500 --> 01:46:29.460
I don't understand.

01:46:30.380 --> 01:46:31.920
Your Highness,

01:46:32.300 --> 01:46:36.760
tell me something that makes sense.

01:46:38.260 --> 01:46:42.390
You poor thing! This is serious, isn't it?

01:46:55.860 --> 01:46:59.830
I was sent down here from the Moon.

01:47:00.200 --> 01:47:01.280
The Moon?

01:47:04.500 --> 01:47:06.580
So that's what it was!

01:47:06.670 --> 01:47:07.540
Yes.

01:47:09.040 --> 01:47:13.460
I only realized that
when His Majesty came.

01:47:14.630 --> 01:47:20.510
And now, on the 15th, I must leave you...

01:47:21.140 --> 01:47:22.930
and go back.

01:47:24.060 --> 01:47:27.480
To the Moon? And leave us?

01:47:29.020 --> 01:47:31.360
What have we done to deserve this?

01:47:31.900 --> 01:47:36.320
Everything we've done has been
for your happiness!

01:47:37.450 --> 01:47:42.330
That happiness you wished for me
was hard to bear.

01:47:43.660 --> 01:47:45.330
Without realizing it,

01:47:45.830 --> 01:47:48.420
l prayed to the Moon to save me.

01:47:49.250 --> 01:47:53.670
When His Majesty embraced me,
my heart screamed out:

01:47:54.380 --> 01:47:56.760
"I don't want to be here!"

01:47:58.430 --> 01:48:02.720
You deliberately called them
to take you back?

01:48:02.800 --> 01:48:06.600
How could you?

01:48:06.680 --> 01:48:09.350
What have you done?

01:48:09.770 --> 01:48:12.810
But I don't want to go. Not like this!

01:48:13.110 --> 01:48:14.820
Then why not just stay?

01:48:15.190 --> 01:48:18.610
Fine! Even if they come to take you,

01:48:18.700 --> 01:48:20.570
l won't let them!

01:48:20.660 --> 01:48:21.910
It's too late

01:48:22.160 --> 01:48:23.370
for everything!

01:48:25.490 --> 01:48:29.790
What have I been doing down here?

01:48:30.750 --> 01:48:34.040
Throwing tantrums about
belonging to someone,

01:48:34.340 --> 01:48:36.710
ignoring your wishes,

01:48:36.800 --> 01:48:40.930
and fooling myself with
fake meadows and mountains!

01:48:43.350 --> 01:48:47.310
But now that I have to leave,

01:48:48.430 --> 01:48:50.480
I finally remember...

01:48:52.690 --> 01:48:57.480
why I came down to this place,

01:48:58.690 --> 01:49:02.610
and why, in this strange land,

01:49:02.700 --> 01:49:05.660
I'd always known that song.

01:49:07.620 --> 01:49:13.960
<i>Birds, bugs, beasts</i>

01:49:14.040 --> 01:49:16.540
That's right.

01:49:17.630 --> 01:49:21.550
I was born to truly live!

01:49:21.880 --> 01:49:23.680
Just like the birds and the beasts.

01:49:28.970 --> 01:49:30.430
I don't want to leave!

01:49:31.310 --> 01:49:34.770
Do you think I'd let you go?

01:49:35.400 --> 01:49:39.730
From the day I took you
out of that bamboo stalk,

01:49:40.400 --> 01:49:43.820
I've loved you
as if you were my own child!

01:49:46.570 --> 01:49:52.160
When I held you, changed you,
set you on your feet,

01:49:52.750 --> 01:49:56.540
I was as happy as if I were in Heaven!

01:50:02.470 --> 01:50:04.630
It's not too late!

01:50:04.720 --> 01:50:08.010
You're still here!

01:50:08.100 --> 01:50:10.930
Here in my arms!

01:50:12.270 --> 01:50:13.810
We'll drive them away!

01:50:14.770 --> 01:50:18.230
No matter how many come for you!

01:50:19.270 --> 01:50:20.440
Is anyone here?

01:50:21.190 --> 01:50:23.990
Prepare to defend the Princess!

01:50:27.620 --> 01:50:30.200
I'm sorry, Father.

01:50:42.340 --> 01:50:44.720
What a racket!

01:50:48.220 --> 01:50:50.560
Let's sing to keep up our spirits.

01:51:00.230 --> 01:51:04.280
<i>Round, round, go round</i>

01:51:04.360 --> 01:51:08.070
<i>Waterwheel go round</i>

01:51:08.160 --> 01:51:11.790
<i>Go round, and call Mr. Sun</i>

01:51:12.080 --> 01:51:16.120
<i>Go round, and call Mr. Sun</i>

01:51:16.370 --> 01:51:20.210
<i>Birds, bugs, beasts</i>

01:51:20.460 --> 01:51:24.130
<i>Grass, trees, flowers</i>

01:51:24.460 --> 01:51:28.300
<i>Bring spring and summer, autumn and winter</i>

01:51:28.390 --> 01:51:32.510
<i>Bring spring and summer, autumn and winter</i>

01:51:34.770 --> 01:51:40.480
<i>Go round, come round, come round</i>

01:51:40.560 --> 01:51:45.900
<i>Come round, O distant time</i>

01:51:46.190 --> 01:51:51.700
<i>Come round, call back my heart</i>

01:51:51.780 --> 01:51:57.000
<i>Come round, call back my heart</i>

01:51:57.410 --> 01:52:02.500
<i>Birds, bugs, beasts</i>

01:52:03.130 --> 01:52:07.510
<i>Grass, trees, flowers</i>

01:52:08.680 --> 01:52:13.970
<i>Teach me how to feel</i>

01:52:17.180 --> 01:52:22.520
<i>If I hear that you pine for me</i>

01:52:23.020 --> 01:52:29.900
<i>I will return to you</i>

01:52:34.910 --> 01:52:36.660
There's another verse to that song?

01:52:38.080 --> 01:52:39.460
Long ago,

01:52:39.540 --> 01:52:44.840
someone who'd come back from here
used to sing it on the Moon.

01:52:47.340 --> 01:52:51.840
When you put on the robe of the Moon,
you lose all memory of this place.

01:52:52.430 --> 01:52:54.300
All grief and sadness are gone.

01:52:55.890 --> 01:53:01.520
But when she sang that song,
tears would come to her eyes.

01:53:04.730 --> 01:53:09.900
And for some reason,
that magic took my heart, too.

01:53:11.610 --> 01:53:15.370
And now I understand exactly how she felt.

01:53:16.740 --> 01:53:19.910
And why I yearned for here,
and broke the rules,

01:53:20.370 --> 01:53:23.630
and maybe why I was sent down here.

01:53:24.540 --> 01:53:25.460
Princess!

01:53:26.500 --> 01:53:27.590
She wanted

01:53:28.250 --> 01:53:29.590
to come back here.

01:53:30.170 --> 01:53:33.840
I'm sure of it!

01:53:36.220 --> 01:53:40.430
"If I hear that you pine for me,
I will return to you."

01:53:42.060 --> 01:53:45.150
"If you are truly waiting for me,

01:53:45.650 --> 01:53:48.860
l will come straight back."

01:53:48.940 --> 01:53:53.150
I want to go home! Right now!

01:53:59.040 --> 01:54:02.660
Prepare a carriage, please.
Don't tell anyone.

01:54:52.010 --> 01:54:53.630
All these ginger flowers!

01:55:20.620 --> 01:55:22.580
It has been a long time.

01:55:22.830 --> 01:55:25.710
-Num-nums!
-What? Are you hungry?

01:55:34.340 --> 01:55:35.550
Did you hear that singing?

01:55:37.510 --> 01:55:38.550
Nope.

01:55:39.340 --> 01:55:40.600
I'll go on ahead.

01:56:02.410 --> 01:56:05.160
Sutemaru? Is that you?

01:56:05.620 --> 01:56:06.580
Li'l Bamboo?

01:56:07.460 --> 01:56:08.920
Can I call you that?

01:56:14.880 --> 01:56:17.220
We've just gotten back.

01:56:17.590 --> 01:56:21.260
Coming over the pass,
I thought I heard you singing.

01:56:21.340 --> 01:56:23.050
I'm so glad to see you!

01:56:25.390 --> 01:56:26.770
Uh, yeah.

01:56:29.020 --> 01:56:31.980
But why are you here,
and dressed like that?

01:56:32.060 --> 01:56:34.770
All this time, I've wanted to come home.

01:56:36.030 --> 01:56:37.030
Home?

01:56:38.900 --> 01:56:40.570
-Here?
-Yes.

01:56:42.910 --> 01:56:44.910
Didn't you like the capital?

01:56:46.580 --> 01:56:51.920
You had nice clothes,
a mansion, fine food...

01:56:52.000 --> 01:56:56.460
I was always thinking about
how we all used to play here.

01:56:56.800 --> 01:56:59.590
They'll all be here soon.

01:56:59.670 --> 01:57:01.720
With you, Sutemaru...

01:57:05.970 --> 01:57:10.730
With you, Sutemaru,
I might have been happy.

01:57:12.190 --> 01:57:13.480
With me?

01:57:14.440 --> 01:57:16.110
I realize that now.

01:57:18.190 --> 01:57:19.110
Yeah, right!

01:57:20.450 --> 01:57:23.110
You couldn't live like we do.

01:57:23.200 --> 01:57:26.780
I definitely could!
I did when we were kids.

01:57:37.170 --> 01:57:38.340
In these clothes?

01:57:39.340 --> 01:57:41.340
Half-starving, eating roots?

01:57:43.220 --> 01:57:45.930
Sometimes having to steal?

01:57:46.010 --> 01:57:47.180
I saw that!

01:57:49.390 --> 01:57:51.850
I got you beaten up.

01:57:52.230 --> 01:57:53.640
That was nothing.

01:57:53.900 --> 01:57:58.150
You're right! As long as you can
answer back by being alive.

01:58:01.280 --> 01:58:03.650
I'm sure I would have been happy.

01:58:08.740 --> 01:58:09.740
Li'l Bamboo!

01:58:11.910 --> 01:58:13.040
But it won't happen.

01:58:14.210 --> 01:58:15.330
It's too late.

01:58:15.960 --> 01:58:16.960
Too late?

01:58:19.460 --> 01:58:21.090
The Emperor?

01:58:21.460 --> 01:58:24.340
No! No one will own me!

01:58:24.680 --> 01:58:26.470
-Well, then...
-It won't happen.

01:58:26.550 --> 01:58:28.300
Why not? We could start now.

01:58:30.520 --> 01:58:32.730
Let's run away. Right now!

01:58:33.100 --> 01:58:35.270
I'll carry you on my back.

01:58:35.560 --> 01:58:38.440
We'll go far away, where no one knows us.

01:58:39.570 --> 01:58:41.820
I can't run away now.

01:58:42.320 --> 01:58:43.820
Yes, you can!

01:58:44.110 --> 01:58:46.530
If they find us, I'll protect you!

01:58:46.610 --> 01:58:48.200
They've already found me.

01:58:48.910 --> 01:58:50.160
What do you mean?

01:58:51.370 --> 01:58:52.450
I've been found.

01:58:55.160 --> 01:58:56.460
So you've been found.

01:58:57.500 --> 01:58:58.460
So what?

01:58:58.920 --> 01:59:01.460
Who cares? I want us to run away!

01:59:05.840 --> 01:59:06.840
Come on!

01:59:08.430 --> 01:59:09.600
Sutemaru!

01:59:11.180 --> 01:59:12.100
Right!

01:59:15.850 --> 01:59:18.190
I'll run, too! As fast as I can!

01:59:40.130 --> 01:59:41.170
Li'l Bamboo!

01:59:41.710 --> 01:59:44.380
-Li'l Bamboo!
-Sutemaru!

02:00:11.280 --> 02:00:14.580
O heaven and earth! Take me in!

02:01:42.460 --> 02:01:45.710
Please! Let me stay a little longer!

02:01:46.750 --> 02:01:51.590
Just a little longer, to feel
the joy of living in this place!

02:01:51.670 --> 02:01:54.590
What do you mean? I'm holding you!

02:01:54.680 --> 02:01:57.720
Hold me tighter! Don't let me go!

02:02:01.980 --> 02:02:02.890
Li'l Bamboo!

02:02:04.560 --> 02:02:05.600
Li'l Bamboo!

02:02:23.750 --> 02:02:24.670
Li'l Bamboo!

02:02:26.580 --> 02:02:27.500
Li'l Bamboo!

02:02:30.340 --> 02:02:31.170
A dream?

02:02:35.680 --> 02:02:36.890
I dreamed that?

02:02:39.850 --> 02:02:41.270
Daddy!

02:02:42.430 --> 02:02:43.850
Daddy!

02:02:59.450 --> 02:03:00.580
Daddy!

02:03:17.050 --> 02:03:21.890
<i>Now, at last, 15th August came round.</i>

02:04:08.690 --> 02:04:09.650
Loose arrows!

02:04:44.180 --> 02:04:45.060
Princess!

02:04:45.640 --> 02:04:46.560
Princess!

02:04:48.100 --> 02:04:49.640
Princess!

02:04:50.270 --> 02:04:52.480
Princess!

02:04:53.150 --> 02:04:54.110
Princess!

02:05:24.350 --> 02:05:25.510
Princess...

02:06:28.870 --> 02:06:32.540
<i>Round, round, go round</i>

02:06:32.620 --> 02:06:36.500
<i>Waterwheel go round</i>

02:06:36.580 --> 02:06:40.300
<i>Go round, and call Mr. Sun</i>

02:06:40.590 --> 02:06:44.470
<i>Birds, bugs, beasts</i>

02:06:44.550 --> 02:06:48.220
<i>Grass, trees, flowers</i>

02:06:48.510 --> 02:06:52.430
<i>Flower, bear fruit, and die</i>

02:06:52.520 --> 02:06:54.440
<i>Be born, grow up, and die</i>

02:06:54.520 --> 02:06:55.730
Princess.

02:06:57.270 --> 02:06:58.150
Princess.

02:06:59.860 --> 02:07:00.940
Princess!

02:07:02.110 --> 02:07:03.110
Princess.

02:07:04.990 --> 02:07:07.030
-Princess!
-Princess.

02:07:10.030 --> 02:07:11.290
-Princess!
-Princess.

02:07:13.700 --> 02:07:14.660
Princess!

02:07:15.370 --> 02:07:20.540
<i>Lifetimes come and go in turn</i>

02:07:24.130 --> 02:07:26.050
Princess! Don't go!

02:07:27.510 --> 02:07:28.510
Wait!

02:07:29.390 --> 02:07:30.550
Please, wait.

02:07:32.010 --> 02:07:33.810
Once I don this robe,

02:07:34.270 --> 02:07:37.770
l will forget everything about this place.

02:07:38.400 --> 02:07:40.230
Give me a little more time.

02:07:43.360 --> 02:07:44.570
-Princess!
-Princess!

02:07:49.410 --> 02:07:51.240
Mom! Dad!

02:07:53.490 --> 02:07:54.370
Princess!

02:07:54.450 --> 02:07:56.960
Take us with you!

02:07:58.370 --> 02:08:00.960
Dad, Mom... please forgive me!

02:08:02.170 --> 02:08:04.090
Come along.

02:08:04.380 --> 02:08:07.470
In the purity of the City of the Moon,

02:08:07.550 --> 02:08:12.390
leave behind
this world's sorrow and uncleanness.

02:08:12.470 --> 02:08:13.720
It's not unclean!

02:08:16.930 --> 02:08:18.850
There's joy, there's grief.

02:08:18.940 --> 02:08:22.360
All who live here feel them
in all their different shades!

02:08:22.980 --> 02:08:25.530
There are birds, bugs, beasts,

02:08:25.610 --> 02:08:26.820
grass, trees, flowers...

02:08:27.440 --> 02:08:28.780
and feelings.

02:08:32.490 --> 02:08:33.450
Princess!

02:08:33.870 --> 02:08:34.740
Princess!

02:08:45.550 --> 02:08:46.840
Princess!

02:08:47.720 --> 02:08:48.840
Princess!

02:09:09.990 --> 02:09:11.610
-Princess!
-Princess!

02:09:16.660 --> 02:09:18.870
-Princess!
-Princess!

02:09:40.430 --> 02:09:44.310
Forgive me!
